      "message": "this needs to be like:\n\nkeep a found flag:\n\n```\nbool found \u003d *outCodecInfo \u003d\u003d null;\n\n// iterate through typeToInfoList for (format-\u003e\"getMediaType\"(), DECODER).\nfor (info : list) {\n  if (found \u0026\u0026 info-\u003esupportsFormat(format)) {\n    // return info\n    *outCodecInfo \u003d info;\n    return OK;\n  }\n  if (info \u003d\u003d *outCodecInfo) { // start after a previous result\n    found \u003d true;\n  }\n}\nerror case: no more such codecs.\n*outCodecInfo \u003d null;\nreturn NOT_FOUND;\n\n\n  \n\n```",
